message: "If you use or discuss this serious-game prototype, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Pantaleo"
    given-names: "Adriano"
title: "Sahel Climate Actions: A Great Green Wall Multi-Actor Serious Game Prototype"
version: "2.5-human-playtest-candidate"
date-released: 2026-08-18
abstract: >-
  A five-role cooperative-competitive institutional serious-game prototype for
  Tabletop Simulator modelling coordination among public authority, technical
  assistance, territorial investment, agriculture and pastoral systems under
  climate, water and land-restoration pressures in the Sahel. The release
  contains the TTS human-playtest candidate and a Lua Guided Turn Manager.
keywords:
  - "serious games"
  - "tabletop simulation"
  - "Tabletop Simulator"
  - "Great Green Wall"
  - "Sahel"
  - "climate resilience"
  - "land restoration"
  - "pastoral mobility"
  - "agriculture"
  - "institutional coordination"
  - "climate services"
